[Lisa Lete]]"],"published":"2026-07-06","created":"2026-07-08","description":"BLACKFOOT — A choir unique to eastern Idaho is preparing to take the stage for the second full concert in its young history. The Southeast Idaho Queer Choir, founded last September by Blackfoot resident Erick Graham-Wood, will present “Echoes of Us: A Queer Concert Experience” on Friday, July 10, at the ARTitorium in Idaho Falls. […]"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},